  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'What the Scene view draws for a selected player: movement lines, resizing
    outlines, line styles per mode, Baseline ghosts, the selected step, the Scene
    Gizmos settings, the draggable start and end handles, and Edit Path in Scene.
    Work in the Scene view with a tile selected; expand animations in the Inspector
    to draw them (the default Show is Expanded Animations).


    <b>Using this board:</b>
    select a tile. Its Inspector shows these directions at the top, with Select buttons
    for the objects to watch, and its UI Animation Player underneath. Badges in a
    tile''s corner say what it needs: <color=#FF9E5E>PREVIEW</color> (the Play buttons,
    out of play mode), <color=#FF9E5E>PLAY MODE</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>INSPECTOR</color>,
    <color=#FF9E5E>SCENE VIEW</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>CONSOLE</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>POP-OUT</color>
    (an animation''s own window).


    In play mode: right-drag pans, the wheel
    zooms, Tab steps through tiles, Home shows them all.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
