  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z1
  Title: Chained moves
  Summary: Four moves in a row, none with a From. Each is drawn from where the one
    before leaves the dot.
  Watch: this tile's player, Dot
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 216011456}
  - {fileID: 1548241474}
  HowTo: Select the tile and expand Tour. Look at the Scene view. Play Tour.
  Expect: 'A closed loop: three dotted lines (Current) with arrows, each starting
    where the last ended, and a dashed fourth line (Baseline) back to the start.
    The drawing holds still while the preview moves the dot.'
  Needs: 13
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
