  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Grow's outlines fade in towards the end, and OutBack's overshoot
    shows as an outline bigger than the last. The number of outlines follows the
    setting. With an Out ease the last moments bunch up near the end, and no outline
    is drawn within a few points of an end.
