    Drag Tilted Grow's edges. Drag Z Kept's corner and read its To.
  Expect: Pop In's From grows outwards in whichever direction you pull (never a negative
    scale). The tilted outline's handles follow its tilt. Z Kept's Z stays 3 whatever
    you drag.
