  Code: Z12
  Title: Handles on top of each other
  Summary: Open's end and Close's start sit on the same point.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1176787728}
  HowTo: Expand both. Hover the shared point. Click Close's step in the Inspector
    and hover again. Drag it.
  Expect: The name that shows is the handle you'll drag. Once Close's step is selected
    it's drawn on top, and dragging moves Close's From, not Open's To.
