  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z4
  Title: Size Delta handles
  Summary: The last outline of a resizing step has corner and edge dots that change
    To; with a From, the first has rings that change From.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1646638820}
  HowTo: Expand all three. Drag corners and edges of each, with and without Shift.
    Play each.
  Expect: Each box grows around its pivot (centre), so dragging the right edge moves
    the left one too. Shift on a corner keeps the box's shape; on an edge the other
    side grows with it. Played back, each lands on the dropped outline. Modes are
    kept; Current Snapped rounds on release.
  Needs: 13
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
