  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z6
  Title: Offset Min / Max handles, bottom-left pivot
  Summary: Offset Min only moves the bottom-left corner, Offset Max only the top-right.
    A size step on a bottom-left pivot grows up and right.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1834275635}
  HowTo: Expand all three and look at the handles. Drag them. Play each.
  Expect: Min has handles only on the bottom-left corner and the left and bottom
    edges; Max only top-right. Pivot Grow has no handles on its left and bottom edges
    (they sit on the pivot and can't change anything). Everything lands where dropped.
