  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z3
  Title: Dragging a move's ends
  Summary: A move's To dot and (with a From) its From ring can be dragged; the value
    keeps its mode.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1919021445}
  HowTo: 'Expand both. Hover the dot and ring of With From (a white ring and a name
    like ''With From, step 1: To'' appear). Drag both, then Play. Drag Current Snapped''s
    dot and let go. Ctrl+Z.'
  Expect: Dropped ends land exactly where let go when played. With From's values
    stay Baseline; Current Snapped's stays Current and is rounded to whole numbers
    only on release. Each drag is one Undo step. Current Snapped has no ring to drag
    (no From).
  Needs: 13
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
  Header: {fileID: 1868192233}
  Stage: {fileID: 1258896580}
  Footer: {fileID: 784593687}
