  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z13
  Title: Where handles can't be dragged
  Summary: Ball's player uses Gizmo Set (Shared Slide); Ball Inside sits under a
    parent scaled to 0 on X.
  Watch: Ball, Ball Inside
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1872433147}
  - {fileID: 620948060}
  HowTo: Select Ball and expand Shared Slide under Shared Animations; try to drag
    its dot. Then select Gizmo Set.asset, set Preview On to Ball, and drag there.
    Select Ball Inside.
  Expect: Under Shared Animations the drawing is look-only. From the set's Inspector,
    with Preview On, the dot drags and changes the set. Ball Inside draws nothing
    draggable and throws no errors.
  Needs: 12
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
